# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the combined tp4/window-next four-card window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/window-next and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards
# are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head (sed -i 's/tp4-next-1/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file the image
# carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# O4 (SOFT, LAST): O3 again after its own reset, the repeat the verdict needs before a small gap is believed (a GO far above +10% does not need it). Run it only when the window has time left after the gate
# (G2) and the round-host pairs. Duration (estimate): 60 minutes. Soft.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-octo
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,concurrent8_steady,concurrent8_code_equal,concurrent8_code_32k
